WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:06.074
Before building delivery portfolio, define the problem and the decision it will support.

2
00:00:06.074 --> 00:00:10.350
Make the expected outcome measurable, and record what is still an assumption.

3
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:15.871
Use Jira to show the delivery portfolio, then maintain the decision log in Notion.

4
00:00:15.871 --> 00:00:22.242
In Miro, map dependencies across teams so a blocked item is visible before it delays another project.

5
00:00:22.642 --> 00:00:25.327
Ask Gemini to challenge the status summary.

6
00:00:25.327 --> 00:00:30.134
Compare capacity and risk in Excel, then prepare a concise portfolio review.

7
00:00:30.134 --> 00:00:33.942
Focus on the next decision and the owner responsible for it.

8
00:00:34.342 --> 00:00:38.201
Bring the evidence, cost, and next decision into portfolio review.

9
00:00:38.201 --> 00:00:42.586
The output is a shared direction, with clear ownership and a review point.
